  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h3 data-lake-id=\"333485af\" id=\"333485af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u00ae2959\" id=\"u00ae2959\">一、 填空题（共5题）</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"aaT4n\" id=\"aaT4n\"><span data-lake-id=\"u09b45e81\" id=\"u09b45e81\">1. 字符串长度与空间占用 </span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u354ef48c\" id=\"u354ef48c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u143c1837\" id=\"u143c1837\">定义一个字符串 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ue042f4f1\" id=\"ue042f4f1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4f7141f\" id=\"ud4f7141f\">char str[] = &quot;C\\0Language&quot;;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u69f99ba8\" id=\"u69f99ba8\">，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"udc49d7d2\" id=\"udc49d7d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87fab2f7\" id=\"u87fab2f7\">那么执行 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5f1d4e83\" id=\"u5f1d4e83\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub23b6f1c\" id=\"ub23b6f1c\">strlen(str)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucc9e23cc\" id=\"ucc9e23cc\"> 的返回值是 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u342d2d07\" id=\"u342d2d07\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a3cf165\" id=\"u6a3cf165\">_______</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4d8de9fa\" id=\"u4d8de9fa\">，而执行 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5c44e963\" id=\"u5c44e963\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9695c486\" id=\"u9695c486\">sizeof(str)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5b09df78\" id=\"u5b09df78\"> 的返回值是 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u19bbe794\" id=\"u19bbe794\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5960fb92\" id=\"u5960fb92\">_______</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9aff808f\" id=\"u9aff808f\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u872799d7\" id=\"u872799d7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uccb8dcb4\" id=\"uccb8dcb4\">​</span></strong><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"HaUjG\" id=\"HaUjG\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucec6a585\" id=\"ucec6a585\">2. 字符串输入与空格处理</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0c33bd92\" id=\"u0c33bd92\"> 有如下代码段：</span></h4><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22char%20str%5B20%5D%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22%E8%AF%B7%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%EF%BC%9A%5C%22)%3B%5Cnscanf(%5C%22%25s%5C%22%2C%20str)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22iKmmF%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u77a949d6\" id=\"u77a949d6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua7e5a74b\" id=\"ua7e5a74b\">如果用户在键盘上输入 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u75d42361\" id=\"u75d42361\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2b940f90\" id=\"u2b940f90\">&quot;Hello World&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4efb0f35\" id=\"u4efb0f35\"> 并回车，此时数组 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ud1e0ba7b\" id=\"ud1e0ba7b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55053166\" id=\"u55053166\">str</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4b0a5829\" id=\"u4b0a5829\"> 中实际存储的字符串是 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7c6c8e3a\" id=\"u7c6c8e3a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u81f6c651\" id=\"u81f6c651\">_______</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud230adc0\" id=\"ud230adc0\">。若想完整读入包含空格的整行字符串，在 C 语言中推荐使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u039bd750\" id=\"u039bd750\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0310eaad\" id=\"u0310eaad\">_______</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2a570be8\" id=\"u2a570be8\"> 函数（提示：可限制读取长度以防越界）。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ubf333e47\" id=\"ubf333e47\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubd3c8b36\" id=\"ubd3c8b36\">​</span></strong><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"n1ooJ\" id=\"n1ooJ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u76e8aa7f\" id=\"u76e8aa7f\">3. 结构体内存对齐 </span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u3261e08d\" id=\"u3261e08d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf444b92c\" id=\"uf444b92c\">在64位标准系统下，有如下结构体定义：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22struct%20Data%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20char%20a%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20int%20b%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20short%20c%3B%5Cn%7D%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LlwM7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u89cc53f3\" id=\"u89cc53f3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9b2ff95a\" id=\"u9b2ff95a\">该结构体变量实际占用的内存大小为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u08d6f9a0\" id=\"u08d6f9a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1adda881\" id=\"u1adda881\">_______</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc8ca9667\" id=\"uc8ca9667\"> 字节。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u510ef6a6\" id=\"u510ef6a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11d0d691\" id=\"u11d0d691\">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"kRlrs\" id=\"kRlrs\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33d7b804\" id=\"u33d7b804\">4. typedef 语法简化 </span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u2a2533ae\" id=\"u2a2533ae\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0670808b\" id=\"u0670808b\">若想将 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u69b1ea3f\" id=\"u69b1ea3f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u56dc18d8\" id=\"u56dc18d8\">struct Student</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ucf191402\" id=\"ucf191402\"> 类型简化，使得后续可以直接用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uca4d10b3\" id=\"uca4d10b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucaf6e69b\" id=\"ucaf6e69b\">Stu</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uebc1c126\" id=\"uebc1c126\"> 来定义变量（例如 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4432951a\" id=\"u4432951a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc30eeb17\" id=\"uc30eeb17\">Stu s1;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uee3bdd91\" id=\"uee3bdd91\">），应当使用关键字 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ue8488a24\" id=\"ue8488a24\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4d566ed\" id=\"uc4d566ed\">_______</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua45e0606\" id=\"ua45e0606\">，其完整的声明语句为：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua220070a\" id=\"ua220070a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6049ba88\" id=\"u6049ba88\">_______ struct Student { ... } Stu;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u48359785\" id=\"u48359785\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u709bc326\" id=\"u709bc326\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubc50689f\" id=\"ubc50689f\">​</span><br></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"X7061\" id=\"X7061\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23c29feb\" id=\"u23c29feb\">5. 动态内存开辟 </span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u7b71148a\" id=\"u7b71148a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d84adf6\" id=\"u3d84adf6\">使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"udba608e3\" id=\"udba608e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15ba7bb4\" id=\"u15ba7bb4\">malloc</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u45eb6d4b\" id=\"u45eb6d4b\"> 函数申请了 5 个 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf26bf607\" id=\"uf26bf607\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub404f67e\" id=\"ub404f67e\">int</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u90a58d31\" id=\"u90a58d31\"> 型大小的堆内存，其完整的表达式为： </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a3a6965\" id=\"u2a3a6965\"><code data-lake-id=\"u4dd9497a\" id=\"u4dd9497a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb0bc813\" id=\"ubb0bc813\">int *ptr = (int *)malloc(_______);</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u013d5088\" id=\"u013d5088\"> </span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ube23218e\" id=\"ube23218e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3cf0f006\" id=\"u3cf0f006\">在使用完毕后，为了防止内存泄漏，必须调用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u128bd8f9\" id=\"u128bd8f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc8ca799\" id=\"udc8ca799\">_______(ptr);</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u75c71885\" id=\"u75c71885\"> 释放该内存。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"569263fd\" id=\"569263fd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u44e4ca9c\" id=\"u44e4ca9c\">二、 编程题（共5题）</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"880bfd82\" id=\"880bfd82\"><span data-lake-id=\"u389e6b1f\" id=\"u389e6b1f\">6. 字符串逆序输出</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u4709b72c\" id=\"u4709b72c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uee70ebd7\" id=\"uee70ebd7\">题目要求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uef355e21\" id=\"uef355e21\">：编写一个函数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub34df38c\" id=\"ub34df38c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf71b6722\" id=\"uf71b6722\">void reverseString(char *str)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud2f390b0\" id=\"ud2f390b0\">，不使用第三方字符串库函数（如 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uce2c7b45\" id=\"uce2c7b45\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c548113\" id=\"u5c548113\">strlen</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud226c8d8\" id=\"ud226c8d8\"> 等），直接通过字符指针将传入的字符串原地逆序（例如输入 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5fda1251\" id=\"u5fda1251\"><span data-lake-id=\"u859cf200\" id=\"u859cf200\">&quot;abc&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u557a9a3b\" id=\"u557a9a3b\">，函数执行后字符串变为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7fda8c8d\" id=\"u7fda8c8d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uccd8efe5\" id=\"uccd8efe5\">&quot;cba&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u50af94e0\" id=\"u50af94e0\">）。</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"0e21c3f1\" id=\"0e21c3f1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b9c4477\" id=\"u4b9c4477\">7. 结构体定义与信息打印</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u21897194\" id=\"u21897194\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9ea3b8b4\" id=\"u9ea3b8b4\">题目要求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u85c3e777\" id=\"u85c3e777\">：</span></p><ol list=\"ud17a65ea\"><li fid=\"u3384f941\" data-lake-id=\"ufb300fc1\" id=\"ufb300fc1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufb807798\" id=\"ufb807798\">定义一个商品结构体 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u22c4ef2b\" id=\"u22c4ef2b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud5f43497\" id=\"ud5f43497\">Product</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u734716f3\" id=\"u734716f3\">，包含成员：商品名称 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u9bd3764f\" id=\"u9bd3764f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b204d7b\" id=\"u3b204d7b\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u79d6f9d2\" id=\"u79d6f9d2\">（字符串）、库存数量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6c3205cd\" id=\"u6c3205cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54f388dd\" id=\"u54f388dd\">stock</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u1d10d46f\" id=\"u1d10d46f\">（整数）、单价 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u79ceb2d3\" id=\"u79ceb2d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"udafc5184\" id=\"udafc5184\">price</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub25e049a\" id=\"ub25e049a\">（浮点数）。</span></li><li fid=\"u3384f941\" data-lake-id=\"udc633ac0\" id=\"udc633ac0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9cb40ec1\" id=\"u9cb40ec1\">编写一个函数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7671b32a\" id=\"u7671b32a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue27690a7\" id=\"ue27690a7\">void printProduct(struct Product *p)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u42912191\" id=\"u42912191\">，使用</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u33ac3983\" id=\"u33ac3983\">指针和箭头运算符 </span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u9e5a7961\" id=\"u9e5a7961\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5082e673\" id=\"u5082e673\">-&gt;</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"ubb2347fb\" id=\"ubb2347fb\"> 打印出该商品的详细信息。</span></li></ol><h4 data-lake-id=\"119c01a9\" id=\"119c01a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u421aca1c\" id=\"u421aca1c\">8. 函数传参：值传递 vs 地址传递</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ua4319a22\" id=\"ua4319a22\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5fb34021\" id=\"u5fb34021\">题目要求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u77e72e38\" id=\"u77e72e38\">：编写一段代码验证值传递和地址传递的区别。</span></p><ol list=\"u2f22c654\"><li fid=\"u7d578c9f\" data-lake-id=\"u61cd7435\" id=\"u61cd7435\"><span data-lake-id=\"u41f5f253\" id=\"u41f5f253\">定义一个结构体 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5aefae99\" id=\"u5aefae99\"><span data-lake-id=\"u759ae549\" id=\"u759ae549\">struct Counter { int count; };</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ufa07b695\" id=\"ufa07b695\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u7d578c9f\" data-lake-id=\"u30129335\" id=\"u30129335\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2574c1fc\" id=\"u2574c1fc\">编写两个函数：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u96157b8c\" id=\"u96157b8c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e1df877\" id=\"u8e1df877\">void addOneValue(struct Counter c)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u74aff815\" id=\"u74aff815\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ue6ff2572\" id=\"ue6ff2572\"><span data-lake-id=\"u47835a7a\" id=\"u47835a7a\">void addOneRef(struct Counter *c)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u385af872\" id=\"u385af872\">，分别让其中的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua2b2eaab\" id=\"ua2b2eaab\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba7fb46e\" id=\"uba7fb46e\">count</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u43a95d73\" id=\"u43a95d73\"> 成员自增 1。</span></li><li fid=\"u7d578c9f\" data-lake-id=\"u85925d40\" id=\"u85925d40\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45f03887\" id=\"u45f03887\">在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc54a6745\" id=\"uc54a6745\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2d32f50\" id=\"ub2d32f50\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud36e7d06\" id=\"ud36e7d06\"> 函数中观察哪个函数能真正改变外部变量的值。</span></li></ol><h4 data-lake-id=\"59d0cac0\" id=\"59d0cac0\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua0d4a6c1\" id=\"ua0d4a6c1\">9. 堆内存申请与赋值</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"ucf8dff6e\" id=\"ucf8dff6e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u884d74d4\" id=\"u884d74d4\">题目要求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u40b0ea9b\" id=\"u40b0ea9b\">：在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u51e20667\" id=\"u51e20667\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5817c15c\" id=\"u5817c15c\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u994ddab2\" id=\"u994ddab2\"> 函数中，使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u56bc2c35\" id=\"u56bc2c35\"><span data-lake-id=\"uebdd046e\" id=\"uebdd046e\">malloc</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub9b266b7\" id=\"ub9b266b7\"> 动态申请一个可以存放 10 个整数的连续堆空间。使用循环将 1~10 赋值进去，并打印出来。最后务必记得释放内存，并将指针置为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4ee1a1ca\" id=\"u4ee1a1ca\"><span data-lake-id=\"u85934a50\" id=\"u85934a50\">NULL</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u98ccc5eb\" id=\"u98ccc5eb\">。</span></p><h4 data-lake-id=\"63ae689a\" id=\"63ae689a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87d83070\" id=\"u87d83070\">10. 函数内申请堆内存（返回值形式）</span></h4><p data-lake-id=\"u847622e6\" id=\"u847622e6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0a1a2ea4\" id=\"u0a1a2ea4\">题目要求</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u13402301\" id=\"u13402301\">：</span></p><ol list=\"u8475c62b\"><li fid=\"u962afd14\" data-lake-id=\"u35d3f14f\" id=\"u35d3f14f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c63aa32\" id=\"u7c63aa32\">编写一个函数 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6d7d5e82\" id=\"u6d7d5e82\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1823e688\" id=\"u1823e688\">char *getMemoryCorrect(int size)</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uae07be1a\" id=\"uae07be1a\">。该函数内部调用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf0658274\" id=\"uf0658274\"><span data-lake-id=\"u85e235df\" id=\"u85e235df\">malloc</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua6a0c850\" id=\"ua6a0c850\"> 动态申请 </span><code data-lake-id=\"udb70935a\" id=\"udb70935a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5ac16cb\" id=\"ue5ac16cb\">size</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u425c25b8\" id=\"u425c25b8\"> 字节大小的堆空间，并</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua67e1150\" id=\"ua67e1150\">通过 </span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u32b21c23\" id=\"u32b21c23\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e66a920\" id=\"u0e66a920\">return</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf525c944\" id=\"uf525c944\"> 关键字将申请到的内存首地址返回给调用者</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue2fbdeae\" id=\"ue2fbdeae\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u962afd14\" data-lake-id=\"uf325c667\" id=\"uf325c667\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f925a68\" id=\"u5f925a68\">在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u07f7a10a\" id=\"u07f7a10a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5efc09de\" id=\"u5efc09de\">main</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u8a55669d\" id=\"u8a55669d\"> 函数中，定义一个字符指针 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf204cef3\" id=\"uf204cef3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u42056946\" id=\"u42056946\">char *str = NULL;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf680ff28\" id=\"uf680ff28\">，调用该函数申请 100 字节的空间。</span></li><li fid=\"u962afd14\" data-lake-id=\"u2f69f578\" id=\"u2f69f578\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaf0eef05\" id=\"uaf0eef05\">判断内存是否申请成功，若成功则使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u749c8245\" id=\"u749c8245\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04aceb87\" id=\"u04aceb87\">strcpy</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue8b597ea\" id=\"ue8b597ea\"> 将字符串 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub4438ce6\" id=\"ub4438ce6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2ead85fb\" id=\"u2ead85fb\">&quot;Success_via_Return&quot;</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uea9d2b64\" id=\"uea9d2b64\"> 拷贝进去并打印出来。</span></li><li fid=\"u962afd14\" data-lake-id=\"u262debd3\" id=\"u262debd3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15e87ec2\" id=\"u15e87ec2\">规范编写释放内存的代码</span><a href=\"https://www.yuque.com/icheima/cprogram/yrio1h14vdwdkc4i\" data-lake-id=\"u3c7c270a\" id=\"u3c7c270a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u42b7aacf\" id=\"u42b7aacf\">.</span></a></li></ol>",
